{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34181","headline":"杂讽九首 六 · 陆龟蒙","name":"杂讽九首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有蘖何青青，空城雪霜里。\n千林尽枯槁，苦节独不死。\n他遭匠石顾，总入牺黄美。\n遂得保天年，私心未爲耻。\n高从宿枭怪，下亦容蝼蚁。\n大厦若抡材，亭亭托君子。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34181.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34181","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}